docs: say plainly that Pin Only is required, and when

The table listed Pin Only under a heading that said two required checks,
without saying which of the three it was. Branch protection is not checked
in, so the document was the only place a reader could learn it, and it did
not say.

It is required as of this change. The ordering is stated too, because it
cannot be otherwise: a required context that nothing has ever published
blocks every pull request including the one that adds it, so the gate ships
first and protection is updated straight after.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QXdYT4LUBt3fwtJ4mCoVZ2
